---

# Key Takeaways

- The OSI Model has seven layers.
- Each layer performs a specific networking function.
- Routers operate at Layer 3.
- Switches operate at Layer 2.
- TCP is reliable.
- UDP is faster.
- Understanding the OSI Model helps troubleshoot and secure networks.
